*.bin

# Downloaded Limine bootloader payloads. The Makefile's `limine-fetch` target
# pulls these from the GitHub release when they are missing, so they do not
# belong in history; the sources (limine.c, Makefile, LICENSE, the .h) stay.
limine-binary/*.EFI
limine-binary/*.efi
limine-binary/*.bin
limine-binary/*.sys
limine-binary/*.exe
limine-binary/limine
limine-binary/limine-tool-windows-x86/

